  m_text: 'DEAR YOUNG TRAVELER


    I have heard many great words about you. I call
    upon you to awake my sacred Pumgeese from their slumber. Take the next sailboat
    to my island of Tornviken, and we will speak about the matter at my abode.


    YOUR
    PRINCE, ANKIG'
